+        "source_line_number": 360,
+        "sink_file_path": "inc/class-destination-folder.php",
+        "sink_line_number": 62
+      },
+      "reason": "The REST bulk-delete route and local-folder delete sink are both real, and the Phase 3a mismatch is again a sink-location correction because `process_bulk_actions()` starts at `src/Backups/API/Rest.php:360` while `BackWPup_Destination_Folder::file_delete()` starts at `inc/class-destination-folder.php:62`. I recommend keeping the finding `UNCERTAIN` because the ordinary backups UI does withhold a ready-made delete payload from users lacking `backwpup_backups_delete`, but the same low-privileged user still appears able to derive the needed `job_id`, destination, and filename from backups-list HTML returned under the broader `backwpup` permission.",
